      "content": "The Spot Administration API provides endpoints for managing organizations, accounts, users, access policies, cloud credentials, subscriptions, and event notifications within the Spot by Flexera platform. It enables programmatic control over user permissions, account setup, and cloud provider credential linking for AWS, Azure, and GCP.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Spot by Flexera",
